cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its artifacts, please cite the associated paper."
title: "AquaAgent-OSPy: An Auditable LLM Tool-Agent System for Simulation-Grounded Irrigation Decision Support"
abstract: >-
  AquaAgent-OSPy is an A4-class code-executing LLM tool-agent that orchestrates
  AquaCrop-OSPy irrigation scenario simulations, NSGA-II multi-objective optimization,
  Google Earth Engine site context verification, and an illustrative seasonal-irrigation
  safety checker to generate auditable action memos with full tool provenance.
